TASK-048 done — Stall integration test: examples/go-timed/stall_test.go spawns rtid -mode=timed-demo with -timed-stall-skip + -timed-stall-advance-ms; rtid drives a stall scenario through runTimedStall (Enable+NER for 2 of 3 federates, FakeClock.Advance(10s), CheckStalls) and emits "TIMED_HALT halts=N stalled_federate=H" on stdout; the test parses the line and asserts halts ≥ 1 and that the stalled federate is one of the pending peers.
